**2026-09-04 update — desktop app superseded.**  The entity finding below for the Claude
Code desktop app (Code tab) was superseded by an owner-verified ruling on 2026-09-04: use
**two literal ASCII spaces** there now.  The 2026-08-19 entity advice for that surface is
withdrawn.  (This does not change the Cursor-chat default above — that is a different
